; mapview.eval - the editor map's wheel zoom and its toolbar hover (code-review
; C373, C374). Judged by tools/EditorTest.py phase 41, on its scratch world,
; with the pointer's pixels put in from mapaim.eval: ET_ZX ET_ZY near the map's
; far corner, ET_LX ET_LY the Level button's centre.
;
; Every pointer here is the MOUSE (`pressmouse`): put at a window pixel, then
; wheeled or clicked in the frame after the line, so the editor's own Update
; hit-tests and acts on it - not a handler called by name.
;
;   --- zoom ---   one baseline at zoom 1, then a notch OUT there (already at
;                  the limit), notches in (1, 1, 3), twenty more (clamped at
;                  10), one more at 10, and thirty out (back to 1). Each
;                  `editor view at` names the map point under the pointer,
;                  which every zoom must keep; the two at a limit must not move
;                  the pan at all (the old inline zoom left out the editor's
;                  edge-handle margin, so each notch slid the point away from the
;                  pointer, and a notch at a limit still rewrote the pan).
;   --- hover ---  the pointer over the Level button lights it (hover=level,
;                  the control), then a click there opens Level settings - and
;                  under the dialog, with the editor's Update stopped, nothing
;                  is left hovered (it stayed lit, its tooltip under the dim).
;                  Esc closes the dialog.
;   --- modal ---  the pointer over a square hovers it (cell=x,z, the
;                  control), then Level settings opens by the CONSOLE - a path
;                  with no click site to clear anything - and two frames later
;                  the square is no longer hovered: a Render with no Update
;                  before it dropped every hover (MapView::ClearHover). Only a
;                  frame that DRAWS can show it, so the judge runs this script
;                  with its window; headless, the square stays hovered.

logecho on
reset
timescale 0
editor
echo --- zoom ---
pressmouse move ET_ZX ET_ZY
editor view at ET_ZX ET_ZY
pressmouse wheel ET_ZX ET_ZY -1
editor view at ET_ZX ET_ZY
pressmouse wheel ET_ZX ET_ZY 1
editor view at ET_ZX ET_ZY
pressmouse wheel ET_ZX ET_ZY 1
editor view at ET_ZX ET_ZY
pressmouse wheel ET_ZX ET_ZY 3
editor view at ET_ZX ET_ZY
pressmouse wheel ET_ZX ET_ZY 20
editor view at ET_ZX ET_ZY
pressmouse wheel ET_ZX ET_ZY 1
editor view at ET_ZX ET_ZY
pressmouse wheel ET_ZX ET_ZY -30
editor view at ET_ZX ET_ZY
echo --- hover ---
pressmouse move ET_LX ET_LY
editor view
pressmouse left ET_LX ET_LY
editor levelsettings status
editor view
presskey esc
editor levelsettings status
echo --- modal ---
pressmouse move ET_ZX ET_ZY
editor view
editor levelsettings open
echo (a frame drawn under the dialog)
echo (and another)
editor view
editor levelsettings status
presskey esc
editor levelsettings status
echo --- end ---
